                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='8957' id='76' type-v2='text' w='12001' x='86785' y='69870'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true'>Percentiles: </run>
                    <run>A value below which a specific percentage of data falls. E.g., 90th percentile (or P90) means 90% of values are lower.

</run>
                    <run bold='true'>Median:</run>
                    <run> The middle value (P50) in your data when ordered from lowest to highest. It&apos;s not affected by extreme values.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
